"""
  |OMC_BTS:
  | ------------------------------------------------------------
  |  rtpm_parse -- Parses Real Time PM collected data
  | ------------------------------------------------------------
  |  Usage: rtpm_parse -mfilter <MFILTER> -cfilter <CFILTER> -short [-q]
  |
  |  -mfilter <MFILTER>
  |         allows selection of particular measurement(s) to be shown on screen after RTPM file parsing
  |         The comma separated list of measurement names or symbols is expected
  |         e.g.
  |
  |         -mfilter LTE_Cell_Load,LTE_RRC,M51123
  |
  |         It selects following measurement tables:
  |          1. LTE_Cell_Load (M8001).
  |          2. LTE_RRC (M8008).
  |          3. LTE_Ethernet_Link (M51123).
  |
  |  -cfilter <CFILTER>
  |         allows selection of particular counter(s) to be shown on screen after RTPM file parsing
  |         The comma separated list of counter symbols is expected. It is also allowed to specify
  |         range symbols.
  |         e.g.
  |
  |         -cfilter M8008C0,M8008C6..M8008C9,M51123C20+
  |
  |         It selects following counters:
  |          1. The M8008C0 counter.
  |          2. Range of counters from M8008C6..M8008C9 (start and end must be from the same meas. table).
  |          3. Range of counters from M51123C20 till the end of M51123 measurement table
  |
  |  -short
  |         forces using abbreviated counters name instead of full name in parsed output
  |
  |  -q
  |         quiet mode - do not print parsed data, only write to RTPM_Data.pl file
"""
